# Everything here is generated from `crates/ffi` by `just ffi-bindings`. It is
# ignored rather than committed so it cannot drift from the Rust it came from:
# if it is not in the tree, nobody can edit it by hand and then wonder why the
# next build overwrites them. What *is* committed is `package.json` and
# `ubrn.config.yaml` — the inputs.
